        <p>\OUNTy BotsOUGH OF WARRINGTON.— EDUCATION COMMITTER. The SITIO AND BCILDINIati COMMITTER are prepared to receive, from Architects practising within the County Borough of WarringPon, plans for the erection of a Public Elementary School at Latchford. A copy of the Conditions and Instructions to competing Architects, together with a plan of the site, may be obtained on and after rdonday. the 12th December. 1904, on payment of £1 Is. (which will be returned on the receipt of a bona-fide set of plans from J. MOORE MURRAY, Secretary snd Director. Education Offic., Sankey street, Warrington, 9th December, 15C4.</p>
