        <p>AN INFALLIBLE R EMEDY I ! Breakfast Creek, Brisbane Queensland Dear Sir,—Some 15 years ago I had the misfortune be attacked with Rheumatic *out. I tried nearly all the doctors here, but they did not do me much good. I saw your advertisement and obtained some of your pills, and I can assure you quickly got relief. When I feel any of the pains coming on, two or three pills gen- erally take them away. Many of my friends have used them, and all say they are an infallible remedy. For myself, I say there are none to equal them. Yours truly S. L. HOWMAN. EADE'S GOUTPILLS , Are perfectly safe in their action, eliminate all In- jurious matter, and are highly restorative. I Sold everywhere in Bottles, is lid and 2s 9d, or sent post free for stamps or P.O. by the Proprietor 1 GEORGE BADE, 232, Goswell road, London. EAD E S GOUT &amp; RHEUMATIC PILLS.</p>
        <p>A RECORD CURE! 32, Archer-street, Bayswater, London, W. Dear Sir,—Sunday night my big toe pained me, on Monday it was much worse, and in the evening I could scarcely walk. At 6 p.m. I sent for a bottle of your Gout Pills, and took two at once. At 9.30 1 was much relieved, and could eat my supper. I took another before going to bed, and although so hot I got a fair night's rest. I have taken two more pills to-day, and now, at 6.30, lam alright again. This is a record cure. Yours truly, PHILIP BRANS. EADE'S GOUT PILLS Are perfectly safe in their action, eliminate all injurious matter, and are highly restorative. Sold everywhere in bottles, is. id. and 2s. 9d. or sent post free for stamps or P.O. by the proprietor, GEORGE EADE, 232, Goswell road, London.</p>
        <p>A GOOD FAMILY MEDICINE CHEST; w improved a prudent use, has saved many a life, and yet we think the idea might upon and reduced to a more simple form. Take some Compound such as COCKLE'S ANTIBILIOUS PILLS.</p>
        <p>and we find that the desired end may be obtained without scales and weights, or little mysterious compartments, and enchanted bottles with crystal stoppers. Others might be used but</p>
        <p>COCKLE'S PILLS as tested by many thousands of persons, and found to answer their purposes so well, may be set down as the best.—Observer.</p>
